Consent-Management
===================
Checking the Consent Documents
-------------------------------

1. Log in to Castellum by using your username and password

   - Make sure you are connected to the WiFi and use your right username and
     password
     
2. Click on **Consent documents** and then on **Admin** on the front page

3. Scroll all the way down and press **Consent documents**
   
   - You will see a list of all consent documents that have been created
   - Additional information that will be shown to you: date of creation and
     whether the consent document is valid or not
     
